=C. The one-hour limit, behavior rules, and sign-in table make the proposal seem organized and manageable.#Correct. Step 1: identify the language, mood, figurative language, rhetorical choice, claim, or appeal named in the question. Step 2: connect that choice to its effect on the audience using the embedded source. This answer works because it explains function and effect instead of only naming the topic.
